@startuml managed_agent_cli_flow
title Managed Agent CLI Runtime Flow

' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/cli/CampusClawCommand.java (call, createAgentSession, configureDelegation)
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java (prepare, materialize)
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/MateServiceClient.java (constructor @Value path templates, getAgentRuntime, querySkillInfo)
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/session/AgentSession.java (initialize, setAgentRuntime, setDelegationState)
' Source baseline: superheromeZzh/pi-mono-java commit 1e9d4ee2e14717764f8403c20375c55512cbd97b
' Observed behavior: only the explicit CLI --agent-id path uses the CampusMate materializer.
' Architecture change: HTTP V1 and managed CLI share the .campusclaw location but retain separate file contracts and loading flows.
' Architecture change: outbound MateServiceClient endpoint templates are injected from application configuration.

actor User
participant "CampusClawCommand" as CLI
participant "AgentRuntimeManager" as Runtime
participant "Local Agent Cache" as Cache
collections "Application Config" as Config
participant "MateServiceClient" as MateClient
participant "CampusMateService" as Mate
participant "ToolCatalog" as Catalog
participant "LocalAgentDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "AgentSession" as Session

User -> CLI: cli --agent-id agentId
Config -> MateClient: @Value endpoint path templates
CLI -> Runtime: prepare(agentId)
Runtime -> Cache: load complete .campusclaw snapshot

alt complete local snapshot
  Cache --> Runtime: PreparedAgentRuntime
else snapshot missing or unreadable
  Runtime -> MateClient: getAgentRuntime(agentId)
  MateClient -> Mate: GET configured agent runtime path
  Mate --> MateClient: Agent metadata and Skill coordinates
  MateClient --> Runtime: AgentRuntime
  loop each directly bound Skill
    Runtime -> MateClient: querySkillInfo(skillId)
    MateClient -> Mate: GET configured Skill info path
    Mate --> MateClient: Skill metadata and bound tools
    MateClient --> Runtime: SkillInfo list
  end
  Runtime -> Cache: materialize Agent and Skill files
  Runtime -> Cache: reload materialized snapshot
  Cache --> Runtime: PreparedAgentRuntime
end

Runtime --> CLI: prepared runtime
CLI -> Catalog: refresh(agentRoot)
CLI -> Session: setAgentRuntime(runtime, manager)
opt dispatcher bean is available
  CLI -> Dispatcher: reuse managed runtime dispatcher
  CLI -> Session: setDelegationState(entry)
end
CLI -> Session: initialize(derived SessionConfig)
Session -> Cache: load system prompt and Skills
Session -> Catalog: resolve allowed local tools
Session --> User: interactive or one-shot CLI

note over CLI,Session
The HTTP V1 controllers do not enter this flow.
They read manager-provisioned agent/{agent_id}/.campusclaw files.
end note

@enduml
